WEBVTT

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:32.173
Sometimes, they would share clothes,

00:02:32.173 --> 00:02:34.982
and even shoes.

00:02:34.982 --> 00:02:39.649
But their lives ended up differently,

00:02:39.649 --> 00:02:41.646
in two different paths.

00:02:43.039 --> 00:02:46.754
The other girl is my little sister.

00:02:46.754 --> 00:02:51.677
My little sister was only 11 years old

00:02:51.677 --> 00:02:54.329
when she got pregnant.

00:02:56.029 --> 00:02:59.742
It's a hurtful thing.